From f668aba22e7fbc0da63e9ff02418419f8588c2e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 08:34:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Choose among qualifying evolutions at random

Gather the admitted ordinary targets before drawing so every eligible slot has
an equal chance. Keep the requirement threshold, model/options checks, ordered
raised-history exclusion and fallback, and leave In-Training and special routes
alone. Remove the stat-average comparison and its retained accumulator.

Mix the existing 15-bit game RNG with the live refresh counter at evolution and
reject the incomplete modulo tail. Keep training previews deterministic and
free of RNG draws. Store the translated Square-popup hint in MENU.
